{"duration": 54.41, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "Fleming shoved a greasy petri dish into his pocket, hoping to keep it safe.", "start": 0.05, "end": 3.481}, {"beat": 0, "text": "He feared a clean lab would wash away his accidental experiment.", "start": 3.561, "end": 6.526}, {"beat": 1, "text": "His colleagues snorted, calling him a sloppy scientist.", "start": 6.726, "end": 9.356}, {"beat": 1, "text": "They warned his mess would ruin any real discovery.", "start": 9.436, "end": 11.74}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Some even suggested he quit research altogether.", "start": 11.82, "end": 14.252}, {"beat": 2, "text": "He left the dishes on a dusty bench while on holiday.", "start": 14.452, "end": 16.948}, {"beat": 2, "text": "When he returned, a blue\u2011green mold had taken over one plate.", "start": 17.028, "end": 19.947}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The bacteria right around the mold vanished like magic.", "start": 20.027, "end": 22.715}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Fleming stared, thinking it was just a strange contamination.", "start": 22.795, "end": 25.632}, {"beat": 2, "text": "He quickly set up a new experiment to test the zone.", "start": 25.712, "end": 27.952}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it\u2019s like finding a clean spot on a dirty kitchen floor \u2013 the clean area stands out instantly.", "start": 28.152, "end": 32.739}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The mold was Penicillium rubens, which released a substance that kills bacteria.", "start": 32.939, "end": 36.785}, {"beat": 4, "text": "That substance, penicillin, proved powerful and barely toxic to humans.", "start": 36.865, "end": 40.365}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Fleming published the finding in 1929, coining the name penicillin.", "start": 40.445, "end": 43.943}, {"beat": 4, "text": "He imagined it could be a safe antiseptic for wounds.", "start": 44.023, "end": 46.401}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Ironically, his untidy habit kept the mold alive long enough for the world to discover antibiotics.", "start": 46.601, "end": 51.339}, {"beat": 5, "text": "That mess became the miracle that saved millions.", "start": 51.419, "end": 53.51}], "words": [{"w": "Fleming", "start": 0.119, "end": 0.369, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "shoved", "start": 0.444, "end": 0.619, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 0.644, "end": 0.669, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "greasy", "start": 0.744, "end": 1.069, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "petri", "start": 1.119, "end": 1.369, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "dish", "start": 1.419, "end": 1.594, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "into", "start": 1.619, "end": 1.744, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "his", "start": 1.769, "end": 1.844, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "pocket,", "start": 1.894, "end": 2.419, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "hoping", "start": 2.469, "end": 2.694, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "to", "start": 2.719, "end": 2.769, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "keep", "start": 2.794, "end": 2.919, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "it", "start": 2.944, "end": 2.994, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "safe.", "start": 3.044, "end": 3.421, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "He", "start": 3.626, "end": 3.701, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "feared", "start": 3.776, "end": 3.951, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 3.976, "end": 4.001, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "clean", "start": 4.051, "end": 4.276, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "lab", "start": 4.326, "end": 4.626, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "would", "start": 4.651, "end": 4.726, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "wash", "start": 4.776, "end": 4.976, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "away", "start": 5.001, "end": 5.251, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "his", "start": 5.276, "end": 5.376, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "accidental", "start": 5.451, "end": 5.826, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "experiment.", "start": 5.851, "end": 6.526, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "His", "start": 6.77, "end": 6.845, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "colleagues", "start": 6.895, "end": 7.195, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "snorted,", "start": 7.245,